        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "building-the-huts:1fv0lv9",
          "html": "Build the three <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Pile_of_driftwood\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">piles of driftwood</a> on the beach into their <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Driftwood_hut\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">huts</a>.",
          "text": "Build the three piles of driftwood on the beach into their huts.",
